  "0\00Texture dimensions can't be 0\00https://api.n.m28.io/endpoint/\00h"
  "ttps://api.n.m28.io/server/\00/findEach/\00ws://\00wss://\00Legendary "
  "petals are now easier to find.\0aSquare has been moved to a separate c"
  "ategory.\00Added mob gallery. No pictures at the moment, but maybe eve"
  "ntually.\00Spooky.\00It seems there aren't enough players to support t"
  "he game mode. We've switched back to FFA now.\00You must have done som"
  "ething really bad if she's chasing you.\00Someone overfed this one, yo"
  "u might be next.\00You can now press X to swap your loadout.\00Buffed "
  "Epic Peas a little bit.\00We'll be trying out a new game mode for a co"
  "uple of days: Battle Royale.\0aThere aren't enough players to split am"
  "ong two game modes, so this will be the only game mode available for a"
  " little bit.\00Honey now also slows down movement speed a little bit.\00"
  "It stings. Don't touch it.\00Ants go in, and come out. Can't explain t"
  "hat.\00We'll be playing Battle Royale again for the next couple of day"
  "s.\00New petal announcements will no longer include their names, to ma"
  "ke it a bit more mysterious.\00Avoid touching it, it hurts.\00Mob gall"
  "ery improvements.\00Added Ants.\00The game mode will be polished a bit"
  " better later, for now it's a bit of a work in progress.\00Shiny, cute"
  " and mostly harmless.\00Cute and harmless.\00This one loves flowers.\00"
  "Added spiders.\00Weak and defenseless, but big dreams.\00Added 3 new p"
  "etals.\00Added 2 new petals.\00New petals.\00A few balance tweaks.\00B"
  "uffed Iris.\00These aren't quite as nice as the little bees.\00Changed"
  " value from last change to 2.5 seconds.\00Web now affects mobs.\00Buff"
  "ed Peas.\00Early levels are a bit slower.\00Unknown zone is now a lot "
  "smaller.\0aAll other zones are the same size as before, which means th"
  "e map got smaller.\00A bigger rock. It doesn't do much either.\00Rare "
  "Roses now stick together.\00Rarer drops take a tiny bit longer to desp"
  "awn.\00Turns out Hornets got too smart. Now only a small percentage of"
  " them will be einstein.\00Added Petal Gallery to keep track of which p"
  "etals you've seen.\00It's got wings and it's ready to use them.\00Adde"
  "d 1 new petal.\00Added Egg petal.\00It's hungry and flowers are its fa"
  "vorite meal.\00Reduced Stinger health.\00Flowers now only keep up to 1"
  "0 items after their death.\00A rock. It doesn't do much.\00It's just t"
  "here doing its thing.\00Hornet AI is now a lot smarter. No more herdin"
  "g.\00Flowers now spawn at 3/4 their previous level, rather than half.\00"
  "First petal spawn when changing a slot takes at least 5 seconds.\0aWhi"
  "ch makes quickly swapping loadouts less effective.\00This one is reall"
  "y big, but still cute.\00All flowers are now the same speed, regardles"
  "s of level.\0aMob chase speed adjusted to compensate.\00Battle Royale "
  "now has 3x exp and drop rate.\00Nerfed Rose.\00Petals you haven't unlo"
  "cked will not appear in the title screen anymore.\00Added Cacti to med"
  "ium zone.\00It's a bit temperamental, probably from working all the ti"
  "me.\00Mobs can now drop more than one petal at a time.\00Added Massive"
  " Beetle.\00You now get to keep some of your items and half your level "
  "when you die.\00Window is too large.\00Nerfed Hornet missile damage.\00"
  "Added Massive Centipede.\00Changed map background.\00Leaf, Cactus and "
  "Faster now only apply their effects once they have spawned the first t"
  "ime.\0aEffect still applies if they're reloading after they get destro"
  "yed.\00Hornets were accidentally made a lot more common a couple of da"
  "ys ago, that has been fixed.\00Web movement speed debuff increased.\00"
  "Cute and harmless... if left unprovoked.\00Legendary Egg hatch time ne"
  "rfed.\00Improved changelog UI.\00We're back to FFA.\00Added Ladybug va"
  "riant to ???.\00Changed flower health from 100-200 (lvl 1-45) to 100-1"
  "50.\00This shape... it looks familiar...\00Connecting...\00This pretty"
  " little flower is called...\00Starting in %d...\00Dandelion rarity cha"
  "nged to Rare (now drops a lot more frequently).\00Added a little movem"
  "ent arrow to help find your mouse (disabled by default).\00Changed map"
  " dimensions (total area still the same, just longer sideways).\00Decre"
  "ased ram damage between two low leveled flowers (to curb noobs chasing"
  " each other).\00Added keyboard controls (disabled by default until we "
  "know which players prefer).\00Rare Rose nerfed (-30% heal).\00Petal dr"
  "op rates are now generated automatically.\0aThis will allow a more fai"
  "r distribution of drops based on their rarity (so for example, all epi"
  "cs are equally as rare).\00Nerfed Leaf damage by 20%.\00default,Standa"
  "rd Gamepad,a:b0,b:b1,back:b8,dpdown:b13,dpleft:b14,dpright:b15,dpup:b1"
